{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35675","headline":"下第献所知三首 三 · 李山甫","name":"下第献所知三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年磨镞事锋鋩，始逐朱旗入战塲。\n四海风云难际会，一生肝胆易开张。\n退飞莺谷春零落，倒卓龙门路渺茫。\n今日慙知也慙命，笑余歌罢忽凄凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}